{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
I'm in a [B]fight, not [E]physical [G#m] [F#]
And I'm in a [B]war, but [E]not with this world [F#]
You are the [B]light that's [E]beautiful [G#m] [F#]
And I want [E]more, I want [F#]all that's Yours
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
